    <!-- Prompt Tips Modal -->
    <div class="modal resource-modal" id="promptTipsModal" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="card resource-modal-card">
        <button class="close-x" data-close-modal aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
        <div class="resource-modal-header">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-wand-magic-sparkles"></i>
          <h4>Prompt Tips</h4>
        </div>
        <div class="resource-modal-body">
          <div class="panel-grid">
            <div class="tip-card">
              <div class="tip-header">
                <span class="tip-number">01</span>
                <h4>Structure Your Prompt</h4>
              </div>
              <p>Use the formula: <strong>Subject + Modifiers + Style</strong></p>
              <div class="tip-example">
                <span class="example-label">Example:</span>
                <code>"A fearsome dragon, with polished obsidian scales, glowing red eyes, in dark fantasy style"</code>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="tip-card">
              <div class="tip-header">
                <span class="tip-number">02</span>
                <h4>Be Specific with Materials</h4>
              </div>
              <p>Instead of vague descriptions, specify exact materials.</p>
              <div class="tip-compare">
                <span class="compare-bad"><i class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i> "looks beautiful"</span>
                <span class="compare-good"><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> "smooth gold metal"</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="tip-card">
              <div class="tip-header">
                <span class="tip-number">03</span>
                <h4>One Object at a Time</h4>
              </div>
              <p>Focus on a single subject for best results. Combine multiple assets later in Blender or Unity.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="tip-card">
              <div class="tip-header">
                <span class="tip-number">04</span>
                <h4>Use Pose Keywords</h4>
              </div>
              <p>For characters, add pose terms for better results.</p>
              <div class="tip-tags">
                <span class="mini-tag">T-pose</span>
                <span class="mini-tag">A-pose</span>
                <span class="mini-tag">dynamic action</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="tip-card">
              <div class="tip-header">
                <span class="tip-number">05</span>
                <h4>3-6 Key Details</h4>
              </div>
              <p>Keep it focused. Too many details dilute the output. Prioritize what matters most.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="tip-card">
              <div class="tip-header">
                <span class="tip-number">06</span>
                <h4>Style Keywords</h4>
              </div>
              <p>Add artistic direction for cohesive results.</p>
              <div class="tip-tags">
                <span class="mini-tag">low-poly</span>
                <span class="mini-tag">realistic</span>
                <span class="mini-tag">cartoon</span>
                <span class="mini-tag">voxel</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="panel-footer">
            <p class="footer-tip"><i class="fa-solid fa-lightbulb"></i> <strong>Pro tip:</strong> Mention scale, silhouette, era cues (retro-futurism, dieselpunk), and finish (matte ceramic, lacquered wood) for refined results.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

