  <!-- Pricing Overview -->
  <section class="tool-intro">
    <div class="container">
      <p>TimrX uses a credit-based pricing model that gives you full control over how you spend. Every AI operation on the platform \u2014 whether it is generating an image, creating a video, building a 3D model, or applying textures \u2014 costs a defined number of credits. This means you only pay for what you actually use, and you can allocate your budget across tools in whatever way suits your workflow.</p>
      <p>Credits can be obtained through free signup credits, one-time credit packs, or monthly subscription plans. Subscription plans offer the best value per credit and include additional perks like priority processing and higher resolution outputs. One-time packs are ideal for occasional users who want flexibility without a recurring commitment.</p>
      <p>The credit costs listed below reflect the computational resources each tool requires. More complex operations like video generation and 3D modeling consume more credits than simpler tasks like image generation. All prices are subject to change as new models and features are added to the platform.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

