      <p class="tool-comparison-note">TimrX is the only platform that combines AI image generation with a full creative pipeline including 3D model generation, AI video creation, and 3D-print preparation. If your workflow involves more than just generating images, TimrX eliminates the need to juggle multiple tools and subscriptions by bringing everything into a single browser-based workspace.</p>
